  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div data-testid=\"video-page-container\" id=\"bbc-main\"><div><div data-testid=\"video-page-video-section\"><div><p>First Lady Melania Trump has denied connections to Jeffrey Epstein, telling reporters at the White House that any claims linking the two \"need to end today\". </p><p>In a surprise announcement on Thursday, the first lady called for congressional hearings for survivors of Epstein's sex trafficking.</p><p><a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c3ex07l1qvpo\">Read more here. </a></p></div><p><time datetime=\"2026-04-09T19:00:43.771Z\">2 hours ago</time></p></div><div data-testid=\"tagsAndSocialStyled\"><div><div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\"><p><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/topics/ce1qrvlexjzt\" data-testid=\"internal-link\">Melania Trump</a></p></div><div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\"><p><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/topics/cl7003r72r4t\" data-testid=\"internal-link\">Jeffrey Epstein</a></p></div><div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\"><p><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/topics/cp7r8vgl2lgt\" data-testid=\"internal-link\">Donald Trump</a></p></div><div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\"><p><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/topics/cx1m7zg01xyt\" data-testid=\"internal-link\">United States</a></p></div></div></div></div><div data-testid=\"texas-section-outer\" data-analytics-group=\"true\" data-analytics_group_type=\"texas-20\" data-analytics_group_position=\"2\" data-analytics_group_item_count=\"20\"><div data-testid=\"texas-grid\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/cwykpw99ed2o\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260401-100641-27b89b8af6-2.44.0-3/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/1a66/live/3eb56870-3420-11f1-8606-05fe34b06e1b.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/1a66/live/3eb56870-3420-11f1-8606-05fe34b06e1b.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/1a66/live/3eb56870-3420-11f1-8606-05fe34b06e1b.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/1a66/live/3eb56870-3420-11f1-8606-05fe34b06e1b.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/1a66/live/3eb56870-3420-11f1-8606-05fe34b06e1b.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/1a66/live/3eb56870-3420-11f1-8606-05fe34b06e1b.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/1a66/live/3eb56870-3420-11f1-8606-05fe34b06e1b.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/1a66/live/3eb56870-3420-11f1-8606-05fe34b06e1b.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"The Artemis astronauts show off the Canadian flag patch.\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">Canada's Mark Carney 'so proud' of astronauts in call to Artemis II</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">Jeremy Hansen received a call from the prime minister as Canada's first astronaut to travel into deep space as part of the Artemis II mission.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">US &amp; Canada</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/cgk0e12y1kgo\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260401-100641-27b89b8af6-2.44.0-3/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https:/