-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/0ae2/live/2f00db60-326f-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/0ae2/live/2f00db60-326f-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/0ae2/live/2f00db60-326f-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/0ae2/live/2f00db60-326f-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/0ae2/live/2f00db60-326f-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/0ae2/live/2f00db60-326f-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"A solar eclipse seen from the dark side of the moon\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">Watch: Artemis II's historic lunar flyby... in 90 seconds</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">The four astronauts in the Orion spacecraft set a new record for distance travelled from Earth.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">US &amp; Canada</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/ce3d5gkd2geo\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260401-100641-27b89b8af6-2.44.0-3/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/1904/live/7ae31190-30c8-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/1904/live/7ae31190-30c8-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/1904/live/7ae31190-30c8-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/1904/live/7ae31190-30c8-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/1904/live/7ae31190-30c8-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/1904/live/7ae31190-30c8-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/1904/live/7ae31190-30c8-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/1904/live/7ae31190-30c8-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"A composite image of the Artemis II crew and a photo of the moon they took\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">'Absolutely spectacular': Artemis II crew see first glimpse of far side of Moon</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">Astronauts on the Artemis II mission are on the third day of their journey around the far side of the Moon.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">US &amp; Canada</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/crl10127elgo\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260401-100641-27b89b8af6-2.44.0-3/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/ee93/live/962c62b0-2f26-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/ee93/live/962c62b0-2f26-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/ee93/live/962c62b0-2f26-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/ee93/live/962c62b0-2f26-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/ee93/live/962c62b0-2f26-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/ee93/live/962c62b0-2f26-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/ee93/live/962c62b0-2f26-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/ee93/live/962c62b0-2f26-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Astronauts in the Artemis rocket\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">'Trust us, you look amazing': Artemis II astronauts speak from space</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">The crew on board the Artemis II spoke by video link, sharing messages for their families and experiences of the trip so far.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">US &amp; Canada</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/c3w344wyxg5o\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260401-100641-27b89b8af6-2.44.0-3/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/1d72/live/93cb1130-2ec5-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/1d72/live/93cb1130-2ec5-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/1d72/live/93cb1130-2ec5-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/1d72/live/93cb1130-2ec5-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/1d72/live/93cb1130-2ec5-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/1d72/live/93cb1130-2ec5-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/1d72/live/93cb1130-2ec5-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/1d72/live/93cb1130-2ec5-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Splitscreen. Left, the Artemis II rocket blasts off. Right, BBC correspondent Arunday Mukharji speaks.\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">Why isn't Artemis II landing on the Moon?</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">The US is aiming to be the first country to land humans on the lunar surface again by 2028 - so what's this mission for?</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">US &amp; Canada</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/c8r4e7jpkz6o\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260401-100641-27b89b8af6-2.44.0-3/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/2b5b/live/2229bdd0-2e23-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/2b5b/live/2229bdd0-2e23-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/2b5b/live/2229bdd0-2e23-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/2b5b/live/2229bdd0-2e23-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/2b5b/live/2229bdd0-2e23-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/2b5b/live/2229bdd0-2e23-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/2b5b/live/2229bdd0-2e23-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/2b5b/live/2229bdd0-2e23-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Becky Morelle watches the launch. \"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">'Spectacular!' - BBC journalist's emotional reaction to Artemis II launch</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">Science editor Rebecca Morelle watched from just three miles away as the most powerful rocket ever built blasted off from Florida.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">US &amp; Canada</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/cwydnrmggnno\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260401-100641-27b89b8af6-2.44.0-3/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/3734/live/c0ee5f80-2e68-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/3734/live/c0ee5f80-2e68-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/3734/live/c0ee5f80-2e68-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/3734/live/c0ee5f80-2e68-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/3734/live/c0ee5f80-2e68-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/3734/live/c0ee5f80-2e68-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/3734/live/c0ee5f80-2e68-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/3734/live/c0ee5f80-2e68-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Spectators with their back to the camera as the rocket leaves a trail of smoke in the background against a blue sky\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">Watch the moment Artemis II blasts into space on historic mission</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">After delays and technical issues, the first crewed Moon mission in 50 years finally took off from Florida and is now in Earth's orbit.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">US &amp; Canada</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/ce8l27p3jr8o\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260401-100641-27b89b8af6-2.44.0-3/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/a2b8/live/ee544a30-2e0d-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/a2b8/live/ee544a30-2e0d-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/a2b8/live/ee544a30-2e0d-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/a2b8/live/ee544a30-2e0d-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/a2b8/live/ee544a30-2e0d-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/a2b8/live/ee544a30-2e0d-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/a2b8/live/ee544a30-2e0d-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/a2b8/live/ee544a30-2e0d-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Split screen. A man being interviewed by the BBC is on the left and Ione Wells is on the right.\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">'A historic moment' - Americans react to birthright citizenship case</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">The BBC’s Ione Wells spoke with protesters and attendees outside the Supreme Court hearing on President Donald Trump’s executive order.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">US &amp; Canada</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/cx2vqz4wx9ko\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260401-100641-27b89b8af6-2.44.0-3/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/0f80/live/14a6f930-2e04-11f1-a79a-77e93010d956.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/0f80/live/14a6f930-2e04-11f1-a79a-77e93010d956.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/0f80/live/14a6f930-2e04-11f1-a79a-77e93010d956.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/0f80/live/14a6f930-2e04-11f1-a79a-77e93010d956.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/0f80/live/14a6f930-2e04-11f1-a79a-77e93010d956.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/0f80/live/14a6f930-2e04-11f1-a79a-77e93010d956.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/0f80/live/14a6f930-2e04-11f1-a79a-77e93010d956.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/0f80/live/14a6f930-2e04-11f1-a79a-77e93010d956.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Splitscreen. Left, two astronauts smile at press. Right, an astronaut gives a thumbs up in the rocket.\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">Suited up and ready to go: Watch the Artemis crew's journey to launch</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">From spacesuit fitting to final communications checks in the rocket, the crew prepared for liftoff to begin their 10-day mission.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">US &amp; Canada</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/c3w3d9lqg2xo\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260401-100641-27b89b8af6-2.44.0-3/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/8bd4/live/89232e70-2d94-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/8bd4/live/89232e70-2d94-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/8bd4/live/89232e70-2d94-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/8bd4/live/89232e70-2d94-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/8bd4/live/89232e70-2d94-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/8bd4/live/89232e70-2d94-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/8bd4/live/89232e70-2d94-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/8bd4/live/89232e70-2d94-11f1-934f-036468834728.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"A BBC journalist speaks to camera in a black top, with the a spacecraft in position on the ground on the right.\"></p></div></div><div data-tes