ne' - Americans struggle as petrol prices surge</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">The average price at the pump has topped $4 in the US for the first time since 2022 as the Iran war continues to push up fuel prices. </p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">US &amp; Canada</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/cn9qj30wlr5o\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260401-100641-27b89b8af6-2.44.0-3/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/d239/live/7fa49a50-2d30-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/d239/live/7fa49a50-2d30-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/d239/live/7fa49a50-2d30-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/d239/live/7fa49a50-2d30-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/d239/live/7fa49a50-2d30-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/d239/live/7fa49a50-2d30-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/d239/live/7fa49a50-2d30-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/d239/live/7fa49a50-2d30-11f1-b297-95b0a0a8331e.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Tim Pierce, peach farmer in Alabama, is riding his tractor.\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">As Iran war continues, US farmers absorb rising costs</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">The BBC’s Gary O'Donoghu